Rule 2 (other tensor must be of integral type)
{v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 5
