Rule 3 (input and other tensors must have compatible shapes for broadcasting)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, if ndim(v_1) > ndim(v_2) then ndim(v_1) else ndim(v_2)] : (i ≥ ndim(v_1) ∨ i ≥ ndim(v_2) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) = 1)
