Rule 4 (other tensor's elements must be non-negative and less than number of bits in input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, shape(v_2, 0) - 1] : v_2[i] ≥ 0 ∧ v_2[i] < (if dtype_(v_1) = 1 then 1 else if dtype_(v_1) = 2 then 8 else if dtype_(v_1) = 3 then 16 else if dtype_(v_1) = 4 then 32 else 64)
